						<text><![CDATA[Try our new online Water and Sewer Utility Payment System. Through our secure site, you can pay all or part of your bill with an e-check, credit or debit card for a small convenience fee. Simply click on the link below and follow the instructions.

https://mywateraccount.newarknj.gov/]]></text>
